    {
      "name": "About",
      "type": "comment",
      "parameters": {},
      "node_position": {
        "x": -1700,
        "y": -950
      },
      "size": {
        "x": 1000,
        "y": 230
      },
      "title": "About this material",
      "text": "Painted corrugated container steel: opaque dielectric paint (metallic 0), satin roughness 0.42, broad subtle weathering. No repeating chips or albedo-alpha paint mask: random bright spots do not represent wear. Container frames and fittings use their separate steel material. Shares the ten-rib profile, 6.5 m repeat, normal, height and AO of corrugated, the bare-steel material for light walls. Real edge wear needs geometry-aware placement on corners, seams and handling points, not a tiled noise mask. Export Godot/Godot 4 Standard into data/models/board/textures/structures/common, then Reload assets."
    },
